{"_doc":"Idioms of this series for this learning language (scripts/notes.py from scripts/idioms/<series>[_deck].txt). lem = lexicon keys (lowercase, space separated) matched in a row against gloss tokens; t = shown form; ko/en = short meaning; note_ko/note_en = optional one-line note; n = letters it appears in; first = [letter id, message index]. Patterns win over idioms, idioms over anchors.","lang":"ko","checked":false,"idioms":[{"lem":"마음 들다","t":"마음에 들","ko":"마음에 들다","en":"to like","note_ko":"‘마음에 들다’ 는 ‘좋아하다, 흡족하다’ 예요.","note_en":"마음에 들다 means “to be to one's liking”.","n":3,"first":["c4-l2",4]},{"lem":"생각 들다","t":"생각이 들었어","ko":"생각이 들다","en":"to feel, to think","n":1,"first":["c5-l4",1]},{"lem":"그 뒤","t":"그 뒤로는","ko":"그 뒤","en":"after that","n":2,"first":["c1-l1",2]},{"lem":"한 번","t":"한 번","ko":"한 번","en":"once","n":5,"first":["c1-l5",0]},{"lem":"다시 한 번","t":"다시 한 번","ko":"다시 한 번","en":"once again","n":1,"first":["c1-l5",0]},{"lem":"안 되다","t":"안 된","ko":"안 되다","en":"no good, must not","n":2,"first":["c6-l1",0]},{"lem":"화 나다","t":"화가 났거든","ko":"화가 나다","en":"to get angry","n":1,"first":["c7-l3",0]},{"lem":"손 잡다","t":"손을 잡으러","ko":"손을 잡다","en":"to hold hands","n":1,"first":["c5-l5",1]},{"lem":"자리 잡다","t":"자리를 잡았는데","ko":"자리를 잡다","en":"to settle","n":1,"first":["c8-l4",1]},{"lem":"잘 되다","t":"잘 돼","ko":"잘되다","en":"to go well","n":2,"first":["c4-l3",2]},{"lem":"잘 알다","t":"잘 알아","ko":"잘 알다","en":"to know well","n":2,"first":["c5-l5",3]},{"lem":"얼마 안 되다","t":"얼마 안 되는","ko":"얼마 안 되다","en":"not much, not long","n":1,"first":["c6-l6",0]},{"lem":"신 나다","t":"신이 나서","ko":"신이 나다","en":"to be excited","n":3,"first":["c5-l7",3]},{"lem":"들다 오다","t":"들고 왔어","ko":"들고 오다","en":"to bring (carrying)","n":1,"first":["c1-l2",0]}]}
